      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"... To take charge of, organize, manage and superintend all public ceremonies, celebrations, receptions, greetings of distinguished persons, parades and similar functions held under city auspices by order of the Mayor, unless otherwise directed by the Mayor.\"",
