      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In accordance with the provisions of the aforementioned law and Executive Order No. 1, I also in clarification of the quoted paragraph of Executive Order No. 1, designate Richard C. Patterson, Commissioner of Public Events, as the Chief of Protocol for New York City.",
